## 1295. Find Numbers with Even Number of Digits

## Approach
--  Initailize count = 0, to track how many digits is divisible by 2.
--  Run a foreach loop to traverse array.
--  extract the digits from num, as num = num / 10.
--  If that digit is divisible by 2 then increment the count.
--  After Traversal, Return the count

## Time Complexity : O(n).
Space Complexity : O(1).

SOLUTION : 
class Solution {
    public int findNumbers(int[] nums) {
        int count = 0;
        for (int num : nums) {
            int digits = 0;

            while (num > 0) {
                num = num / 10;
                digits++;
            }

            if (digits % 2 == 0) {
                count++;
            }

        }
        return count;
    }
}
